# What `vercel deploy` must never upload (secrets, local data, build output). Vercel builds from source.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.local/
.vercel/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.next-*/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
.turbo/
**/.turbo/
e2e/test-results/
e2e/playwright-report/
infra/**/.terraform/
infra/**/*.tfstate*
infra/**/*.tfvars
